sequenceDiagram
    participant W as Workload<br/>(pipeline / app)
    participant TS as Token Service<br/>(STS / IdP)
    participant R as Resource<br/>(API / cloud service)

    Note over W: Needs access.<br/>No long-lived secret stored.

    W->>TS: Authenticate<br/>(OIDC assertion / managed identity / federated credential)
    TS-->>W: Short-lived token<br/>(TTL minutes–hours, scoped)
    Note over W: Token held only in memory

    W->>R: Request + short-lived token
    R-->>W: Response

    Note over W: Discard token immediately<br/>(clear from memory / let expire)